<Career id="WARDA-WORK001">
<Description language="ENGLISH">"Wood Elf Wardancer"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"Wardancers rove across the length and breadth of the Wood Elf realms in tightly knit troupes, treading paths and secret ways few others know of or dare use. They are welcomed to Elven halls and treated with the utmost respect, yet also with more than a little fear and wariness. Other Wood Elves regard the Wardancers as wild and unpredictable, and not without cause, for they are the servants and worshippers of the Elven trickster god, Loec, a deity whose conventions are a mystery to those not already committed to his path.
As wanderers and followers of Loec, individual Wardancers can often find themselves traveling through the greater Old World. Pursuing agendas that are often mysteries to other Wood Elves."</Explanation>
